# B1 taps: bank (amber) -> Euclid (green) -> Morse (cyan). Morse word 1 is
# STENCIL; at first boot STEPS/FIT sits in the 1-bar zone, so the word loops
# every 2 s at 120 BPM: 17 dits and dahs a bar, one J8 trigger each.
wait 3000
sing 220
tap b1
wait 400
expect led b1 green
tap b1
wait 400
expect led b1 rgb 10 62 77
wait 2000
mark
wait 4000
expect edges 8 > 30
expect edges 8 < 38
expect cvrange 7 > 4
expect finite
